  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast bias when sentiment is negative (sentiment < 0) — model tends to overestimate prices.",
    "Adjust downward for forecasts that overshoot recent highs — especially after sentiment spikes.",
    "Apply mean reversion correction for persistent over- or under-forecasting — model exhibits inertia.",
    "Lower forecast for early days of new sentiment trends — model reacts too late to sentiment shifts.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to sentiment when sentiment is positive and price is trending down — model underreacts.",
    "Avoid over-optimism in forecasts when sentiment is neutral — model tends to overestimate in flat periods."
  ]
